11. uniq - removes consecutive duplicate texts or detects consecutive duplicate text

for deletion : uniq <filename>
for detection: uniq -c <filename>



sort <filename> | uniq : sorts duplicate data togehter and uniq removes them while

sort <filename> | uniq -c : sorts duplicate data together and uniq counts that how many times a number of word or lien is being repeated



